{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "%@://": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%lld 秒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Claude Code 做完了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code is done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code 出错了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code hit an error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code 在等你回答": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code is waiting for your answer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude Code 在等你批准": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code is waiting for your approval"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notchkeeper": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Pip": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "zsh 里的命令跑了 10 秒以上，结束时弹一张卡，点了跳回那个终端。只有焦点正停在跑这条命令的那个终端上（同一窗口的别的标签、分屏都不算）时不弹。只把命令名交出 shell，参数不出去。vim、ssh、top 这类全屏或交互的命令不弹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a zsh command that ran for 10 seconds or more finishes, a card pops up; click it to jump back to that terminal. No card if you're focused on the very terminal running the command (other tabs or splits in the same window don't count). Only the command name leaves the shell, never its arguments. Full-screen or interactive commands like vim, ssh and top don't pop cards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "—": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "上下翻圈": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次检查": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last Check"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上移": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move Up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下移": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move Down"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不常驻": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "None"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不弹卡，面板里不列会话": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No cards, and no sessions in the panel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不弹红卡，Pip 和面板不显示出口；后台守卫照常检查": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No red card; Pip and the panel don't show the egress. The guard keeps checking in the background"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不是有效的 IPv4 地址，或已在列表里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not a valid IPv4 address, or already in the list."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不是有效的 scheme，或已在列表里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not a valid scheme, or already in the list."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "东张西望": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Look Around"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话列表，做完、出错、等你时弹卡": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Session list; cards when done, on errors, or when waiting for you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "低头看脚": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Look Down"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如 198.51.100.10": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. 198.51.100.10"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如 raycast": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. raycast"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "侧身 90°": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn 90°"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "允许的出口 IPv4": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed Egress IPv4"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全选": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select All"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关于": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉后左耳不画 Pip，右耳也没东西时就是一块纯黑的刘海；展开和弹卡时照常出来": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, the left ear has no Pip, and with nothing on the right ear the notch is plain black. Pip still appears when expanded and on cards"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉后红卡撤下，Pip 和面板不再显示出口；后台守卫照常检查，再打开马上恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The red card goes away and Pip and the panel stop showing the egress. The guard keeps checking in the background; turn it back on to restore everything right away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉提醒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn Off Alerts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关掉的是提醒，不是判定：出口守卫照常检查。外部插件在 ~/Library/Application Support/Notchkeeper/plugins/<id>/manifest.json 登记，关掉后它发来的卡和活动都丢掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turning a plugin off silences its alerts, not its checks: the egress guard keeps checking. External plugins register in ~/Library/Application Support/Notchkeeper/plugins/<id>/manifest.json; when one is off, its cards and activities are dropped."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口 IP 和预期不一致": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egress IP isn't the expected one"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口不合规": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egress not compliant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口不合规时弹出红卡": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show a red card when the egress isn't compliant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口不合规时弹红卡，面板顶上显示出口": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Red card when the egress isn't compliant; egress shown at the top of the panel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口不符": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egress Mismatch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口仍不合规，确定关掉提醒？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The egress is still not compliant. Turn off alerts anyway?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口守卫": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egress Guard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口守卫固定在最上面。各段合起来至多露 %lld 行，排在前面的先拿；多的在段里滚动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The egress guard stays on top. All sections together show at most %lld rows, earlier sections first; the rest scroll inside their section."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口已恢复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egress recovered"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口检查于 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egress checked %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口正常": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egress OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出口还没检查过": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egress not checked yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出错": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换 App": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "列表为空时守卫无法判断出口是否正确，只能显示「暂时查不到出口」（没走隧道仍会报不合规）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With an empty list the guard can't tell whether the egress is right and can only show “Egress unavailable for now” (traffic outside the tunnel is still reported as not compliant)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "刘海": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "剪切": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卡片停留": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Card Duration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卡片和面板里的链接默认只打开 https。这里加的 scheme 也放行：它们能让别的 App 执行动作，只加你信得过的。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Links in cards and the panel only open https by default. Schemes added here are allowed too; they can make other apps perform actions, so only add ones you trust."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "危险": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Danger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卸载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uninstall"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只改 Pip 和刘海的样子，不改出口判定，也不弹红卡、不响；真的红卡照常弹出。不写任何文件，重开 App 就恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only changes how Pip and the notch look: no change to the egress verdict, no red card, no sound. Real red cards still pop up. Nothing is written to disk; relaunching the app restores everything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Startup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "命令跑完时弹卡": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Card When a Command Finishes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "固定展开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always Open"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "固定收起": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always Closed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Claude Code 里装一个 Notchkeeper 自带的 mod，它只记下每个回合怎么结束的，不记对话内容。安装会在 ~/.claude/settings.json 里加一项插件；卸载会去掉。已经开着的会话要重开或运行 /reload-plugins 才生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installs a mod that ships with Notchkeeper into Claude Code. It only records how each turn ended, never the conversation. Installing adds a plugin entry to ~/.claude/settings.json; uninstalling removes it. Sessions already open need a restart or /reload-plugins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Ghostty 中打开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open in Ghostty"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在系统设置中批准": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Approve in System Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
